# Testes

- Unit: `app/tests/unit/{domain,application,infrastructure,presentation}`
- Integracao: adapters de IO em `app/tests/integration`
- Application: fakes tipados pelos ports
- Isolar `.env` com `SNH_DISABLE_DOTENV=1`
- Coverage branch fail-under 100; nao baixar a barra
- Docs: `docs/engineering-standards.md`
